<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Advtech issues cautionary statement.</title>
<headline>Advtech issues cautionary statement.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African electronics firm Advanced Technical Systems Ltd said on Monday that talks are still in progress which could have an impact on its share price and urged shareholders to exercise caution in their dealings in its shares.</p>
<p>It gave no further details in a brief announcement.</p>
<p>Advtech first issued a cautionary about the ongoing negotiations on January 22.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
